# An allowlist for backend/Dockerfile: the image is public, so only what the API needs reaches
# the build. Everything else (.env, Terraform state, personal notes, the rest of data/) can't.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!generator/
!databricks/src/heavden/
!backend/heavden_api/
!docs/corpus/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
